  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Warmth IOM Giving Tuesday 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USA for IOM is proud to announce our #GivingTuesday campaign for 2022, &quot;Water and Warmth.&quot;   We are seeking to support the delivery of important resources at an especially vulnerable time of crisis for the people of Somalia and Ukraine. Any funding raised through this year&apos;s Giving Tuesday campaign will support the Water and Warmth project. In short, the Project will effectively continue to provide life-saving support to millions of migrants in the midst of historic climate crises and conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
